nanoflann v1.9.0, BSD 2-Clause (see COPYING and header).
Source: https://github.com/jlblancoc/nanoflann/tree/v1.9.0
Header URL: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/jlblancoc/nanoflann/v1.9.0/include/nanoflann.hpp
Header SHA256: e91b910b6fcdeaefb0253d50438c519de675980cbf3374397da730dfc23bbfe7
Unmodified upstream header. PRIME uses a bounded heap ResultSet and maps
Euclidean neighbor_eps to squared-L2 tolerance eps*(2+eps).
The complete header notice is also installed from inst/LICENSES/nanoflann.txt
so binary package distributions retain the BSD copyright and license terms.
